---
title: A better 1 cup V60 by James Hoffmann
filter: paper
---

@V60 15g 250g 90°C -- off the boil for light roasts, 90-95°C for medium, 80-90°C for dark
grind medium-fine

/rinse -- preheat
/dig -- a small hole in the middle of the bed
0:00 50g bloom spiral
0:10 /swirl -- gently
0:45 100g ~15s spiral
1:10 150g ~10s spiral
1:30 200g ~10s spiral
1:50 250g ~10s spiral
2:00 /swirl -- gently
2:05 /drawdown

target 3:00 -- expect some variance
